    "created_at": "2016-12-06T08:13:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-06T08:13:00Z",
    "body": "I know some people are taking about Ruby's useful for Latin and other languages, but have never seen single page using it. Have you? \r\n\r\nEither way, it looks like Gecko and Blink doesn't want this. Maybe we should try to reach consensus on it first. Well, it was probably me who added the noise, sorry about that.",
